          "chapter": 5,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "When the king saw Esther the queen standing in the court, she obtained favor in his sight; and the king held out to Esther the golden scepter that was in his hand. So Esther came near and touched the top of the scepter.",
      "ko": "왕후 에스더가 뜰에 선 것을 본즉 심히 사랑스러우므로 손에 잡았던 금홀을 그에게 내어미니 에스더가 가까이 가서 금홀 끝을 만진지라",
      "source_text_hash": "f79823ca7c8cb5943a0c0d7250bd1d2093868608b13548f4fd4c25dba8282309",
      "translation_text_hash": "b843422e52030a02fbe59877a133aae7ac5fe7643408d6dc6dc56c543d54b4b8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
