      "en": "Esther said, “If it seems good to the king, let the king and Haman come today to the banquet that I have prepared for him.”",
      "ko": "에스더가 가로되 오늘 내가 왕을 위하여 잔치를 베풀었사오니 왕이 선히 여기시거든 하만과 함께 임하소서",
      "source_text_hash": "639c02d63594c95d271c5bd5603a176e5a528a82b9e79eff971d6ff8b1aab7cd",
      "translation_text_hash": "37e0579c93d9f6b8bb6c3a3c18b830888dc2471c6e6741078375f0232a380673",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
